{%- comment -%}
  Dark, cinematic enquiry section. Never implies ordinary shopping requires approval — this is a
  plain invitation to enquire, linking to a normal contact/bespoke page.

  Media is dedicated only (desktop + mobile campaign images) — there is deliberately no fallback
  to any product image. An unrelated catalogue photo here (the same fallback the hero and object
  in focus used to reach for) is exactly what let one temporary product image, badge included,
  repeat across the homepage. With no dedicated image, the section shows a clean Obsidian field.

  QUIET INTERLUDE: this is deliberately CAVIERA's calmest section — House/Editions carry the
  homepage's major interactions; Bespoke is secondary, a private invitation, not a sales chapter.
  The CTA moved from a filled .btn to .caviera-link-editorial — an existing, previously-unused
  shared component built for exactly this ("understated actions... text + a fine rule + a small
  directional arrow", see assets/caviera-components.css) — matching the brief's "editorial, not
  button-like" CTA without inventing a new style.

  ANIMATION VISIBILITY FIX: no longer uses the shared, one-shot [data-reveal] observer (assets/
  caviera-global.js) — it fired once, the instant a sliver of the section entered view, well
  before the user was actually reading it, and never fired again on a return visit. Replaced with
  a dedicated, replayable controller (assets/caviera-quiet-interlude.js) that toggles .is-active
  (and .is-receding, for the small exit response) on .caviera-bespoke itself, timed to ~20-30%
  visibility rather than 1px. See assets/caviera-home.css for the actual entrance values.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign bespoke_image = section.settings.image_desktop
  assign bespoke_image_mobile = section.settings.image_mobile | default: section.settings.image_desktop
-%}
<section class="caviera-section caviera-bespoke" data-scheme="obsidian">
  {%- if bespoke_image != blank -%}
    <div class="caviera-bespoke__media">
      <img
        class="caviera-bespoke__media-el caviera-bespoke__media-el--desktop"
        src="{{ bespoke_image | image_url: width: 1920 }}"
        srcset="{{ bespoke_image | image_url: width: 960 }} 960w, {{ bespoke_image | image_url: width: 1920 }} 1920w"
        sizes="100vw"
        width="{{ bespoke_image.width }}" height="{{ bespoke_image.height }}"
        alt="{{ bespoke_image.alt | default: '' | escape }}"
        loading="lazy"
      >
      {%- if bespoke_image_mobile != blank -%}
        <img
          class="caviera-bespoke__media-el caviera-bespoke__media-el--mobile"
          src="{{ bespoke_image_mobile | image_url: width: 900 }}"
          srcset="{{ bespoke_image_mobile | image_url: width: 600 }} 600w, {{ bespoke_image_mobile | image_url: width: 900 }} 900w"
          sizes="100vw"
          width="{{ bespoke_image_mobile.width }}" height="{{ bespoke_image_mobile.height }}"
          alt="{{ bespoke_image_mobile.alt | default: '' | escape }}"
          loading="lazy"
        >
      {%- endif -%}
      <div class="caviera-bespoke__overlay"></div>
    </div>
  {%- elsif request.design_mode -%}
    <div class="caviera-editor-note">No dedicated bespoke image set — showing a clean Obsidian field instead of a stand-in photo. Campaign imagery must not contain marketplace badges, review stars, promotional text or watermarks.</div>
  {%- endif -%}
  <div class="container caviera-bespoke__content">
    {%- if section.settings.heading != blank -%}<h2 class="heading-h2 caviera-bespoke__heading">{{ section.settings.heading }}</h2>{%- endif -%}
    {%- if section.settings.body != blank -%}<p class="body-text caviera-bespoke__body">{{ section.settings.body }}</p>{%- endif -%}
    {%- if section.settings.cta_text != blank -%}
      <a href="{{ section.settings.cta_url | default: '/pages/bespoke' }}" class="caviera-link-editorial caviera-bespoke__cta">{{ section.settings.cta_text }}{%- render 'icon', name: 'arrow-right' -%}</a>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
</section>

<script src="{{ 'caviera-quiet-interlude.js' | asset_url }}" defer="defer"></script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Bespoke enquiry",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "image_desktop", "label": "Desktop campaign image", "info": "Dedicated image only — no marketplace badges, review stars, promotional text or watermarks. No product image is ever substituted automatically." },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "image_mobile", "label": "Mobile campaign image (falls back to desktop image)" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "Some objects begin with a conversation." },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "body", "label": "Body" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "cta_text", "label": "CTA text", "default": "Request an appointment" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "cta_url", "label": "CTA link" }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "Bespoke enquiry" }]
}
{% endschema %}
